Unresolved assumptions and possible later work
----------------------------------------------
- The numerical graph illustrates local/global curve shapes but does not
  prove their topology or connectivity.
- No complete canonical-domain chain or complete set of progressive paths is
  constructed.
- Uniform close-pair matching, any required Airy passage, pole endpoint
  control, gauge/logarithm and sheet monodromy remain open.
- No C_ess or Fedoryuk determinant is constructed, and no equivalence with
  Delta_WI is asserted.
- Local Weber zeros are not assigned to physical Bargmann eigenvalues.
- The corrected geometry exposes no new proved obstruction beyond these
  already named missing global constructions; numerical terminations at a
  pole or another turning-point neighbourhood are not promoted to proofs.
- The Stage 08e formal energy coefficients are unchanged.

